    "title": "Labcorp to Pay $2.28 Million in Settlement Over 2019 Data Breach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Maryann Pugh ,\n21 hours ago HARRISBURG, PA — Labcorp will pay more than $2.28 million and strengthen oversight of vendors handling patient information under a settlement with Pennsylvania and 43 other states stemming from a 2019 data breach that potentially exposed information belonging to more than 27.5 million people, including as many as 218,408 Pennsylvanians. Read full article\n11",
